左右。按这个差距，同一笔住院费每往上跑一级医院，自己多掏的大约是这笔可报销费用的 10%。比如 1 万元可报销的住院费，报销比例从 80% 降到 70%，自己掏的从 2000 元变成 3000 元。多掏的 1000 元是总费用的一成，但比原来自己掏的多了一半。各地实际比例不同，起付线和封顶线也会让差额变化，这里只是按文件的 10 个百分点算的示意。年度新增医保基金也向基层倾斜"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院办公厅 (2026). 关于加快建设分级诊疗体系的若干措施. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065031.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065031.htm"]},"：「因地制宜适当拉开参保人员在不同等级医疗卫生机构的住院报销水平，原则上统筹地区内医疗卫生机构住院报销比例逐级拉开10个百分点左右的差距。」「具备条件的地方，可按分级诊疗导向酌情拉开参保人员在不同等级医疗卫生机构的门诊报销水平。」"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["同一笔住院费，在基层和在三级医院，自己掏的差额可能是几千元。能在基层办完的病别往上跑，并不是什么病都要在社区看。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/24-01"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"常见病先在社区看，经基层逐级转诊上去，住院起付线接着算"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/24-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"要去大医院，走基层转诊或者医院的转诊中心，别找号贩子"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["跨省异地就医之前先在本地问一句，必要性原则上要副主任医师以上评估"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["要不要去外地看病，原则上由二、三级医院副主任医师以上的医生评估。临时外出就医报销多少，和在参保地同级别医院会有差别，具体看本地规定。出发前在本地问一句，比人到了…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["每次看完病，把病历、检查报告和影像自己存一份"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["查阅和复制自己的病历，是法律给你的权利。门诊病历、住院志、化验单、影像、手术和麻醉记录、病理资料、费用清单都能复制。医院有专门窗口受理，只能收工本费。换医院、找…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["对诊疗有疑问就当场要求封存病历，双方在场、开清单、各执一份"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["对治疗有疑问，可以要求把病历封存起来。封存要医患双方都在场，开清单、签字盖章、各拿一份。病历还没写完的，先封已经写完的那部分。怀疑是输液、输血、打针、用药出的问…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["急重的伤病直奔急诊预检分诊台，别去挂号窗口排队"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["急诊不按先来后到，按病情轻重分四级排。定级的地方是急诊入口的预检分诊台，不是挂号窗口。不去分诊，你在系统里就没有级别，伤得再重也只能跟着队伍慢慢挪。到了先报最危…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["没带钱、没带证件、说不清自己是谁，急诊也必须先救"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["国家有一笔疾病应急救助基金，专付两种人的急救费：身份查不出来的，和掏不出钱的。医院不能拒绝或拖延抢救，急救中心也不能因为钱的问题不出车。所以别因为没钱在家硬扛，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/24-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["伤残鉴定要等治疗终结之后再做，做早了等级会评低"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["赔多少钱主要看评几级，评几级看的是治完之后还剩多少功能障碍。标准写明要在治疗终结、或者临床治疗效果稳定之后再做。骨头还没长好、钢板还没取就跑去评，评的是当时那个…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/24"},"children":["阅读整个主题：看病：怎么少花钱少走弯路 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 